<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>round and round</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">bbno$</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">round and round</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4uW97EdIlhNzUS5QUltXMH</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.810" end="00:20.310" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(don’t sell your soul?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.260" end="00:28.260">Man on the moon cut in line for the rhythm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.300" end="00:36.270">Chew on your tongue like a dog go and sick ‘em</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.270" end="00:40.630">Hard wood floors, high heels on the table</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.630" end="00:44.710">That’s the part-time angel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.710" end="00:46.710">Say, do you get down?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.710" end="00:48.500">Tell me what you about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.500" end="00:54.250">Cuz tonight we go ‘round and ‘round and ‘round and round and round</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.250" end="00:58.890" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(‘Round, ‘round and round we go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.890" end="01:02.010">Just let it go, don’t sell your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.010" end="01:06.980" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(‘Round, ‘round and round we go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.980" end="01:10.330">Just take it slow, don’t sell your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.330" end="01:18.200">Hands on the ball read your mind like a crystal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.200" end="01:26.200">Eyes on the prize take ‘em down like a missile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.240" end="01:30.650">Broke beat down don’t care for a label</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.650" end="01:34.650">Come through if you’re able</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.650" end="01:36.800">Say, do you get down?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.800" end="01:38.570">Tell me what you about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.570" end="01:44.250">‘Cuz tonight we go ‘round and ‘round and ‘round and round and round</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.250" end="01:48.970" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(‘Round, ‘round and round we go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.970" end="01:52.180">Just let it go, don’t sell your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.180" end="01:56.830" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(‘Round, ‘round and round we go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.830" end="02:00.000">Just take it slow, don’t sell your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.000" end="02:04.870" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(‘Round, ‘round and round we go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.870" end="02:08.040">Just let it go, don’t sell your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.040" end="02:12.600" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(‘Round, ‘round and round we go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.600" end="02:16.600">Just take it slow, don’t sell your soul</p></div></body></tt>